<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Help center' }) %><body><%- include('partials/navbar') %><main class="help-shell page-shell" id="main-content"><header class="help-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE HELP ALONG THE WAY</p><h1>Hi, how can we help?</h1><p>Find answers for your next stay, your account, and your hosting plans.</p></header><nav class="help-topic-grid" aria-label="Help topics"><a href="#reservations"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'luggage', size: 30 }) %>Your reservations</a><a href="#hosting"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'home', size: 30 }) %>Hosting a place</a><a href="#accounts"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'user', size: 30 }) %>Your account</a></nav>
<section class="help-section" id="reservations"><h2>Reservations and cancellation</h2><details class="faq-item"><summary>How do I book a stay?</summary><div><p>Find a property, choose your check-in and check-out dates, and enter the number of guests. Review the total, then complete the confirmation or checkout. Your confirmed reservation appears in My trips.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Can I cancel a reservation?</summary><div><p>You can cancel a confirmed reservation before its check-in date. Open My trips, select your stay, choose Cancel reservation, and confirm. Once the check-in date has arrived, cancellation is no longer available.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Why are my dates unavailable?</summary><div><p>A property can have only one reservation per night. Choose a different date range or use the date filters to find another available home. Availability is checked again before confirmation.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>How long can I stay?</summary><div><p>You can reserve 1–90 nights, with check-in within the next year. The number of guests must fit the property’s capacity.</p></div></details></section>
<section class="help-section" id="payments"><h2>Payments and refunds</h2><details class="faq-item"><summary>Where can I see my price and payment status?</summary><div><p>Your checkout shows the nightly price and total before confirmation. Open the reservation in My trips to see its payment status. A reservation marked Not collected has no online payment recorded.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>What if payment completes but the stay becomes unavailable?</summary><div><p>The payment is verified before your reservation is confirmed. If the selected stay can’t be reserved, the checkout requests a payment reversal. If the receipt shows Reversal pending, return to the payment verification flow to retry.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Can the price change before I book?</summary><div><p>Yes. If the host updates the nightly price before your confirmation, you’ll need to review a fresh quote. Your original confirmed reservation retains its agreed total.</p></div></details></section>
<section class="help-section" id="hosting"><h2>Hosting your home</h2><details class="faq-item"><summary>How do I create a listing?</summary><div><p>Create an account, open the host dashboard, and select Add a property. Add a name, description, location, price, guest capacity, photos and amenities, then publish.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Who can edit my property?</summary><div><p>Only the account that owns the property can edit its details, change photos or remove it. Guest reservations remain visible in your host dashboard.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>What happens when I remove a property?</summary><div><p>It no longer appears in search, and its reservation history is preserved. Properties with upcoming or active reservations can’t be removed until those stays finish.</p></div></details></section>
<section class="help-section" id="photos"><h2>Property photos</h2><details class="faq-item"><summary>How do I update my photos?</summary><div><p>Open Edit property. Add a cover-image URL and up to four additional photo URLs, or upload a JPEG, PNG or WebP cover of up to 5 MB. Save your property edits before uploading a cover.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>What does the location map show?</summary><div><p>The map shows the city or area entered by the host. Check the listing’s location details before making your reservation.</p></div></details></section>
<section class="help-section" id="accounts"><h2>Your account</h2><details class="faq-item"><summary>How do I change my name or password?</summary><div><p>Open your account menu and choose Account settings. Update your name under Personal info or change your password under Login & security. Changing a password signs out your existing sessions.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>I forgot my password. What should I do?</summary><div><p>Choose Forgot password? on the login page and enter your account email. If recovery email is available, you’ll receive a link that works once and expires after 30 minutes.</p></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>When can I leave a review?</summary><div><p>After completing a confirmed stay, open the property page to add a rating and review. You can edit or remove your own review. Hosts can’t review their own properties.</p></div></details></section>
<section class="help-section" id="privacy"><h2>Your information</h2><details class="faq-item"><summary>Which account details are visible to others?</summary><div><p>Your name may appear with your properties, reservations and reviews. Your email address is used for account access and password recovery. Other guests can’t view your account settings or private reservations.</p></div></details></section>
</main><%- include('partials/footer') %></body></html>
